scripts.text:
{0}
{1}
I... I guess
I must have gotten something wrong.
I'll think about it more and figure out who the robber is...

scripts.translation:
{0}
{1}
我...我想我搞錯了。
我會再仔細想想，找出真正的小偷...

scripts.text:
{0}
Rosa is the thief for sure!!
The reason for the robbery is that~!!

scripts.translation:
{0}
羅莎肯定是小偷！！
偷竊的原因就是那個~！！

scripts.text:
{0}
According to Luen she thought she was the first one to arrive at home.
But she found out that Rosa had arrived before her and still left me lying there unconscious.

scripts.translation:
{0}
據魯恩說，她以為自己是最先回家的。
但她發現羅莎比她更早到家，卻還把我留在那裡昏迷不醒。

scripts.text:
{0}
By making it seem like the necklace, you got from Dames, was stolen you tried to bring the family closer and bring more attention to yourself.
Now~ would you show everyone the necklace and confess?

scripts.translation:
{0}
通過讓那條達姆斯送給你的項鍊看起來像是被偷了，你試圖讓家人更親近，並讓自己獲得更多關注。
現在~你會向大家展示項鍊並承認嗎？

{0}
流浪商人絕對是那個小偷！！
理由如下~！！

scripts.text:
{0}
This kind of robbery is rare in this neighborhood.
In other words, it's very likely that a stranger to this area would be responsible.

scripts.translation:
{0}
這種搶劫案在這個街區很少見。
換句話說，很可能是這個地區的外人乾的。

scripts.text:
{0}
More importantly, smell of alcohol wreaks from you right now!!
Among the stolen items were two bottles of alcohol as well!

scripts.translation:
{0}
更重要的是，你現在身上散發著酒味！！
被盜的物品中還有兩瓶酒！

scripts.text:
{0}
Dames is definitely the one!!
The reason being~!!

scripts.translation:
{0}
達姆斯絕對是那個人！！
理由如下~！！

{0}
達姆斯！我能感覺到
你想釋放妻子帶給你的壓力。

scripts.text:
{0}
Now~ would you show everyone
the necklace and confess?

scripts.translation:
{0}
巴盧明絕對是強盜！！
理由如下~！！

{0}
但我知道達姆斯沒有借給你錢。
我確信這讓你感到失望和沮喪。

{0}
在資金需求下，
你最終決定搶劫這棟房子！！！！

scripts.text:
{0}
Now~ would you show everyone
the necklace and confess?

{0}
Cruyan is definitely the robber!
The reason being~!!

scripts.translation:
{0}
克魯揚絕對是那個小偷！
理由如下~！！

{0}
他一定是偷了項鍊，
以報復羅莎對他與露恩戀情的反對！

{0}
正如你之前所見，羅莎經常對克魯揚大吼大叫，
任何遭受這種對待的人都會開始產生某種報復心理。

{0}
既然你花光了個人積蓄，
你就決定偷你女朋友母親的項鍊！！

{0}
他並沒有就此收手。
他還偷了兩瓶酒。

{0}
他和露恩的關係遭到反對，
主要原因可能是他喜歡賭博和喝酒。他一定是本能地犯了罪！！

{0}
他犯下這樣的罪行，
只是為了獲得與露恩交往的認可！

{0}
從一開始，喜歡賭博和酒精的克魯揚就不受羅莎的喜歡。
他試圖用各種方式改變自己，但是...

scripts.text:
{0}
it's never easy to change anyone's first impression.
Thus, he stole the necklace first and wanted to earn Rosa's trust by acting like he found it again.

scripts.translation:
{0}
改變別人的第一印象從來都不容易。
於是，他先偷走了項鍊，然後假裝是自己撿到的，以此博取羅莎的信任。

{0}
露恩說，在你過來之前，
她絕對沒見過你。

scripts.text:
{0}
Furthermore, the Concentration Potion you gave me as a proof of your alibi is not something you can obtain in the land of the blooming flowers.
It was confirmed that you can get it from the Wandering Merchant.

{0}
No... No way?
Did I make a mistake?

scripts.translation:
{0}
不...不可能？
是我搞錯了嗎？

scripts.text:
{0}
There's no way!
Let's think about it again.

scripts.translation:
{0}
這不可能！
讓我們再想想。

{0}
那是因為你正要偷項鍊的時候，
被露恩撞見了。

